{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":26,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["犹大的凯歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["到那日，犹大境内的人必唱这首歌：",{"text":"“我们有一座坚城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华使祂的拯救成为保护我们的城墙和屏障。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打开城门，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让忠信的公义之民进来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使坚信不移的人全然平安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们信靠你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要永远信靠耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华上帝是永远屹立的磐石。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂贬抑高傲的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拆毁他们高耸的城邑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把它们夷为平地、化为尘土，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被困苦人的脚践踏，被贫穷人的足踩踏。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"义人的道路是平坦的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公正的主啊，你必修平义人所走的道路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，我们在你行审判的路上等候你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们心里渴慕你的尊名和威望。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在夜间，我的心思慕你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的灵切切地寻求你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在世上施行审判的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人就学习行义。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然你恩待恶人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们却仍然不学习行义。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使在公正之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们依然作恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全不把耶和华的威严放在眼里。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你的手高高举起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们却看不见。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿他们因看见你向你子民所发的热心而感到羞愧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿你为敌人预备的火烧灭他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你必赐我们平安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我们所做的事都是你为我们成就的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们的上帝耶和华啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除你以外曾有别的主人管辖我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我们只尊崇你的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们都已死去，再不能复生，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"逝去的灵魂不能再回来。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此你惩罚他们，毁灭他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们被人彻底遗忘。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你增添我们的国民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"增添我们的国民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"扩张我们的疆界，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你得到了荣耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，我们在危难中寻求你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你管教我们的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们就向你低声祷告。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，我们曾在你面前呼求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如临产的妇人在阵痛中呼喊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们曾怀胎，经历产痛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但产下来的却是风。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们没有给世界带来拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也没有给世上带来生命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，属你的逝者必复活，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的尸体必站起来。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"睡在尘土中的人啊，要醒来欢唱！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的甘露如清晨的甘露，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使地下的死人重获生机。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"回到你们的房子里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"关上门躲藏一会儿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等耶和华的愤怒平息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，耶和华要走出祂的居所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惩罚世上犯罪的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地必不再隐藏被杀之人的尸首，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必将流在地上的血显露出来。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/26.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/27.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/25.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}